abstract: '<p>COPASI Skills is a collection of Agent Skills for COPASI analyses through
  Basico.</p>
  <h2>Funding</h2>
  <p>Frank Bergmann is supported by&nbsp;<a href="https://libis.bioquant.uni-heidelberg.de/"
  rel="nofollow">LiBiS</a>, the Baden-W&uuml;rttemberg Institute for Bioinformatics
  Infrastructure:&nbsp; the Federal Ministry of Education and Research (BMBF, Germany)
  within the &nbsp;<a href="https://www.denbi.de/" rel="nofollow">de.NBI</a> research
  network (grant number 031L0104A, W-de.NBI-016).</p>'
